    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Create simple eye-catching carousels that scroll smoothly across your pages, capturing visitors&#8217; attention with ease. Customize the typography, colors, background, and speed to match your site’s design and branding. Perfect for showcasing clients, brands, or any content that needs to stand out. Simple to use and fully responsive.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>CSS only animation</li>\n<li>No JavaScript on the front end</li>\n<li>Accessible dual-track loop with WCAG 2.2.2 motion compliance</li>\n<li>Pause on hover &amp; pause on focus</li>\n<li>Respects user prefers-reduced-motion preferences</li>\n<li>Gradient edge fade masks</li>\n<li>Slider Text and Slider Image block variations with cross-carousel automatic style synchronization</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>0.2.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Enhanced: Migrated 100% to native WordPress components in InspectorControls (__next40pxDefaultSize, __nextHasNoMarginBottom).</li>\n<li>Added: Slider Text (paragraph) and Slider Image (image) block variations with bidirectional style synchronization across the whole carousel.</li>\n<li>Added: Cross-slide automatic visual style synchronization (useStyleSync) supporting both preset attributes and style objects.</li>\n<li>Added: Accessible continuous loop with primary accessible track and aria-hidden / inert clone tracks.</li>\n<li>Added: Pause on hover and pause on keyboard focus (WCAG 2.2.2 compliance).</li>\n<li>Added: prefers-reduced-motion support.</li>\n<li>Added: Gradient edge fade mask toggle.</li>\n<li>Added: Scroll direction toggle (Left to Right / Right to Left).</li>\n<li>Added: Block deprecation handling for backward compatibility with existing posts.</li>\n<li>Fixed: React 18 BlockCrashBoundary crash when rendering inner blocks in the Block Editor.</li>\n<li>Fixed: Unstable useSelect reference warning (Non-equal value keys: 0) by utilizing on-demand store selection.</li>\n<li>Fixed: Horizontal overflow scrollbar container regression on frontend.</li>\n<li>Removed: Deprecated UnitRangeControl component.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.1.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Image height.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Plugin assets url.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Create simple eye-catching, customizable carousels with lightweight block plugin.",
    "description": "<p>Create simple eye-catching carousels that scroll smoothly across your pages, capturing visitors&#8217; attention with ease. Customize the typography, colors, background, and speed to match your site’s design and branding. Perfect for showcasing clients, brands, or any content that needs to stand out. Simple to use and fully responsive.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>CSS only animation</li>\n<li>No JavaScript on the front end</li>\n<li>Accessible dual-track loop with WCAG 2.2.2 motion compliance</li>\n<li>Pause on hover &amp; pause on focus</li>\n<li>Respects user prefers-reduced-motion preferences</li>\n<li>Gradient edge fade masks</li>\n<li>Slider Text and Slider Image block variations with cross-carousel automatic style synchronization</li>\n</ul>\n",
